;@default-font authored/authored-charmaps.otf
;@frames 0 500 1500
; A fallback face whose charmaps are a format 2 subtable, a format 8 one, the
; Unicode charmap FreeType builds from its glyph names and its CFF encoding.
; libass reads text through the format 8 subtable and tries every charmap in
; FreeType's order for a character that does not map, keeping the one that
; maps it, or the last: B through format 8, A through format 2, é and the emoji
; through the glyph names, À only through the encoding, Δ through FreeType's
; second mapping of Delta, Ω through none, and B again through format 2.
